# tls-audit Rule

1. Follow `.agents/skills/tls-audit/references/tls_checklist.md` (TLSX-001 to TLSX-020, TLSX-E-*).
2. Run `scripts/scope_check.sh TARGET`, then `testssl.sh --jsonfile ...` and `.agents/skills/tls-audit/scripts/tls_map_testssl.py`; `scripts/tls_quick.py` for a fast check.
3. Detection only; no renegotiation floods or exploit tools.
